{"time": 1774186434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102978268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（感觉老板也听不太懂）"}
{"time": 1774186453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521175681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“客人是哪里人啊，我听不懂啊”"}
{"time": 1774186466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446802544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "咳，咳嗽一下润润喉，忘掉跑出家那边了"}
{"time": 1774186494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137087316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "拍拍桌子“唉你瞧我这脑子，来这边玩转不过来了”"}
{"time": 1774186506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968965231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“老板生意咋样这边，看起来人也不少呀”"}
{"time": 1774186555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208630971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还可以啊，最近不是中元会要开了，乡里的人都来咱们野荷塘哩”"}
{"time": 1774186641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91240102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“中元会，听起来不错，这里的习俗吗”"}
