{"time": 1774186801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094992101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“过几天中元节在关帝庙会有庙会哦，我们眼前这条河也会有放河灯的活动”"}
{"time": 1774186852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333822006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“平时白天你也可以在河边租船观光哩”"}
