{"time": 1774187881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249064240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "夜里，你被一阵不重不轻的脚步声所吵醒，半睡半醒间，看到有一个“人”在房间内走动，但你的身体无法动弹，像是遇到了鬼压床"}
{"time": 1774187887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159185449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=2801086039]"}
{"time": 1774187903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994505920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“对了对了”压低声音，“老板，今晚我从旅店出来，听到好多小孩在哭，最近这么多家长带孩子来玩吗，问句不吉利的话，这里有没有什么脏东西”"}
{"time": 1774187927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594218868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃尝试憋气让自己醒过来"}
{"time": 1774187977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243712513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没有吧，小孩子不就是会哭吗？我看是家长带小孩来趁着节日祈福的吧”"}
{"time": 1774188011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706745518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“每年都有挺多这种家长的，带着一两岁的孩子过来祈福”"}
{"time": 1774188027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141540501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我猜你们住的旅馆肯定是住满了人吧？”"}
{"time": 1774188038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327480391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这样”摆着若有所思的样子，“看来是我多虑了。”"}
{"time": 1774188044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23843373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=141540501]“这还真瞒不住你呀”"}
