{"time": 1774263721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751264073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=871089479]帮她擦拭眼角的泪痕。\n倪雨带回来的包子，只撕下外层比较清谈的包子皮塞进嘴尝尝味，油水较重的包子馅直接丢进垃圾桶"}
{"time": 1774263725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086589343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃那么一路顺风溜达到关帝庙"}
{"time": 1774263808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529770456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "趁着小孩还在睡觉，下楼去看看旅店老板在不在"}
{"time": 1774263835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026144975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=2801086039] 你朝着昨天打听到的关帝庙的方向前进，一路上有不少的早餐店，散发出阵阵香气，这里的道路并不算宽阔，也没什么人开汽车，基本上都是自行车和摩托车，还有一种独特的三轮蓬车，听吆喝的司机说好像叫“麻木”"}
{"time": 1774263873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575685227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这“麻木”就约等于出租车了"}
{"time": 1774263985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599391678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1529770456]你走下来的时候，正好遇见一个秃顶的中年大叔从外面回来，径直走到前台翻看账本"}
{"time": 1774264059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344394089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“老板早上好，问一下这地方是叫野荷塘吧，我想采莲花要往哪边走？”"}
{"time": 1774264103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849863726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（采九朵莲）"}
