{"time": 1774264148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579896727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（换好几个人了）"}
{"time": 1774264166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683397260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（这是第三个？）"}
{"time": 1774264183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888893314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=344394089]“采莲花的话，沿着河往下游走，湖边会有船的，你去租船就能去采了”"}
{"time": 1774264215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358487832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "秃顶男子边回答你边熟练地在账本上勾勾画画"}
{"time": 1774264303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881319084", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“哦，这边没有专门的荷花塘，都栽是湖里得坐舟去是吧。对了，昨天的桂花糕很好吃，今天什么时候还能发吗？”"}
{"time": 1774264311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341722597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1227929523]派出所人们进进出出，看得出好像很忙的样子"}
{"time": 1774264315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541010322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“哦，这边没有专门的荷花塘，都栽在湖里，得坐舟去是采吧。对了，昨天的桂花糕很好吃，今天什么时候还能发吗？”"}
{"time": 1774264394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721073469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？什么桂花糕？昨天我婆娘发的？”"}
