{"time": 1774275432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480726217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“准备在这呆多久啊”"}
{"time": 1774275474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821733818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“得有个三五天吧，不过最近不是封路吗？要出去也不方便”"}
{"time": 1774275510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277720040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（怎么又变成只有一个pl了"}
