{"time": 1774275557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806395990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是啊，这不是封路出不去嘛，欸，那你住哪啊，有亲戚的房子？”"}
{"time": 1774275562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818029170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "(分线了，有人在挂吊水)"}
{"time": 1774275665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336419952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“对啊，远房亲戚，也不受待见。”"}
{"time": 1774275681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096739358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“也就晚上睡觉去哪儿躺躺”"}
{"time": 1774275728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075139253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“呵呵，我继续等人，你呢？”"}
{"time": 1774275876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533333777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”继续游手好闲呗，说不定走着走着天上能给我掉馅饼”"}
